 role was supposed to be a cover to protect him, but during the course of their life together, Ricardo's behavior became strange. The first thing that comes to mind is that Ricardo's stepdaughter, Lydia, is very interested in her new mommy.\n\nA contractual marriage begins a too-happy married life.\n___\n[Original Web Novel](https://ncode.syosetu.com/n7866hz/)","year":2024,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e1a23218-096e-4a51-afe9-e27177bd9eed/301e9e88-40a2-42e5-a54b-15e8094cc485.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["id","pt-br"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.75,"follows":1638,"listAt":"2026-10-22T13:05:48.541Z","chapters":[{"id":"86b29140-c7e6-4602-b4da-e382bc06755d","number":"2","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"id","pages":36,"createdAt":"2024-09-16T04:02:58+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"7a4e9cdd-ff7b-4d96-80ec-022b08673549","number":"1","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"id","pages":45,"createdAt":"2024-08-31T10:17:31+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:30:17.037Z"},"983c0d0a-8cad-4b1b-b054-d1c0463527ac":{"id":"983c0d0a-8cad-4b1b-b054-d1c0463527ac","title":"Tenken 4koma Gekijou ~Fran to Shishou no Nichijou~","altTitle":"Tenken 4-koma Theater ~Fran and Master's Daily Life~","description":"Official 4-panel comic of the TV anime \"Tensei Shitara Ken Deshita.\" Updated every Wednesday.\n\n**Links:**  \n- [Tensei Shitara Ken Deshita](https://mangadex.org/title/77fd8118-61b0-4b1f-95a6-2b839d754f81/tensei-shitara-ken-deshita) (Based on)","year":2022,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"22","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Comedy","Isekai"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/983c0d0a-8cad-4b1b-b054-d1c0463527ac/7579a63e-d091-44d8-957a-8e70789ccc49.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","pt-br"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.73,"follows":1575,"listAt":"2026-10-25T12:57:2